SUMMARY:Fall Line Harvest Time
DESCRIPTION:Pond at Williamson. Photo by Martha Elliot. \nJoin TLC to explore the Doorstep of the Piedmont!\nTLC Trail Guide Patrick D. will guide you through Williamson Nature Preserve to talk about its location along the North Carolina Fall Line - the geological zone separating the Piedmont and Coastal Plain! Discover the preserve's history and common species found along the Neuse River basin as you walk towards the Johnston County line. This is a 4-mile\, moderate hike and pre-registration is required.
URL:https://triangleland.org/event/fall-line-harvest-time
LOCATION:Williamson Nature Preserve [Staff Entrance]\, 4429 Old Country Mial Rd\, Raleigh\, NC\, 27610\, United States
ORGANIZER;CN="Amaya Horner":MAILTO:ahorner@triangleland.org
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE:Triangle Land Conservancy
