SUMMARY:Take a Child Outside Pollinator Adventure
DESCRIPTION:Join TLC and Trail Mommas for a Pollinator Adventure!\nJoin us for a Take A Child Outside adventure along a portion of the Walnut Way Trail at Williamson Preserve as we discover the fascinating world of pollinators! Kids will explore the trail\, search for pollinators in action\, and learn about the important role these tiny creatures play in our ecosystems. We’ll wrap up our adventure with a fun STEAM-inspired take-home craft that brings the learning home. Come get outside\, get curious\, and discover the incredible world of pollinators! This is a free event\, but registration is required: 
URL:https://triangleland.org/event/take-a-child-outside-pollinator-adventure
LOCATION:Williamson Farm and Nature Preserve\, 4429 Old Country Mial Rd\, Raleigh\, 27610\, United States
END:VEVENT
