SUMMARY:Meet Your Plant Neighbors
DESCRIPTION:Join TLC for an exploration of plants at White Pines Nature Preserve!\nWhich plants do we live amongst? What are their names? What are their stories? On this hike\, we'll amble through the different plant communities of White Pines\, discussing the trees\, shrubs\, and herbs we see along the way. In addition to typical Piedmont plants\, we'll meet some rarer species that are thriving in White Pines' special microclimate. All levels of plant knowledge are welcome!\n\nThis is a free event\, but preregistration is required.\n\n 
URL:https://triangleland.org/event/meet-your-plant-neighbors-4
LOCATION:White Pines Nature Preserve\, 548 S Rocky River Rd\, Sanford\, NC\, 27330\, United States
ORGANIZER;CN="Amaya Horner":MAILTO:ahorner@triangleland.org
END:VEVENT
